Type: Package
Package: Bergm
Title: Bayesian Exponential Random Graph Models
Version: 6.0.0
Date: 2026-10-18
Authors@R: c(
    person("Alberto", "Caimo", email = "alberto.caimo1@ucd.ie", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Lampros", "Bouranis", role = "aut"),
    person("Robert", "Krause", role = "aut"),
    person("Nial", "Friel", role = "ctb"))
Description: Bayesian analysis for exponential random graph models using
    advanced computational algorithms: the approximate exchange algorithm
    with adaptive direction sampling (optionally adaptive, delayed-acceptance
    and parallel), calibrated pseudo-posteriors, adjusted pseudolikelihoods,
    evidence estimation via Chib-Jeliazkov and power posteriors, Bayesian
    data augmentation for missing network data, and Bayesian goodness-of-fit
    diagnostics. More information can be found at:
    <https://acaimo.github.io/Bergm/>.
